# Go
/algo-drum
# `GOOS=js GOARCH=wasm go build ./cmd/wasm/` (or `./...`) with no -o writes
# a plain "wasm" binary here, named after the last path element.
/wasm
*.out
*.test

# Compiled binaries land in the project root whenever someone runs a bare
# `go build ./cmd/<name>`.
#
# This list is every directory under cmd/, enumerated rather than globbed,
# because a glob wide enough to catch an extensionless binary also catches
# directories and stray scripts. Enumerating has one failure mode and it has
# already fired twice: a *new* command is not on the list, so its binary is
# committable, and a 13 MB `paper-figures` and a 6 MB `compare-fits` duly
# reached published history and had to be rewritten out of it on 2026-08-02.
# **Add the entry in the same change that adds the command.**
#
# The physical model's six commands, the fit/render output directories and the
# reference-recording re-inclusion ladder all moved to
# github.com/cwbudde/algo-tom with the model they serve.
/algo_drum.wasm
/gen-voiceparams

# Local cross-repo development against a sibling algo-tom checkout. Never
# committed: check-tidy diffs go.mod/go.sum, and a workspace that resolves
# algo-tom from ../algo-tom passes here and fails on every clean checkout.
go.work
go.work.sum
